QUERY NAME: Query3
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT tblStaff.Name, tblStaff.WorkGroupGrade, MonthlyTime.Month, MonthlyTime.ParentProject, MonthlyTime.TimeCode, MonthlyTime.WorkGroup, MonthlyTime.Hours, MonthlyTime.PACTStaffID
FROM MonthlyTime INNER JOIN tblStaff ON MonthlyTime.PACTStaffID = tblStaff.PACTid
WHERE (((MonthlyTime.TimeCode)="AD6000")) OR (((MonthlyTime.PACTStaffID)="4464"));

